# Decline an Event: Self confirms that they will be absent
# The Response of Self becomes "declined". The other Attendees keep their
# Response and Comment
# It never sends an e-mail to an Attendee (sendUpdates=none)
# Self is the Attendee that is the Account. It fails with
# GCAL_ATTENDEE_SELF_NOT_FOUND when the Account is not an Attendee, before any
# write
# On the master Event of a series, the Response applies to the whole series
# On an occurrence, it applies to that occurrence only
# The eventId is printed by gcal-event-list-raw
# --comment sets the Comment of Self. An empty --comment "" clears it, and
# no --comment keeps the existing one
# Not verified: whether the organizer sees the Comment in the details of the
# Event, without an e-mail
# The Calendar is the Primary by default
# Prints the updated Event as JSON, with the fields of gcal-event-read
# Usage:
# $ gcal-event-decline eventId
# $ gcal-event-decline eventId --comment "Too late for me"
# $ gcal-event-decline eventId --comment ""
# $ gcal-event-decline eventId --calendarId work@group.calendar.google.com
# $ gcal-event-decline eventId --account perso
setopt local_options err_return

local libDir="${functions_source[$0]:A:h:h}/__lib"
node "${libDir}/bin/gcal-event-decline.js" "$@"
